{"kind":"chart","id":"ch/kvqt87a5","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":64,"top":178,"width":800,"height":440},"name":"","chartType":"line","title":"Center-qubit X expectation"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/42o9jd","slideIndex":5,"text":"The ideal value is about 0.971. At 1× noise, the uncorrected value fell to 0.674. Full PNA brought it to 0.954; SLC-selected PNA brought it to 0.938. SLC saves work but can leave more bias, which is the intended tradeoff."}
